 "t": 92.67165729885755, "r": 524.423795146331, "b": 65.97585707558255, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 93]}]}], "headings": ["3.3 Evaluation Results"], "captions": null, "origin": {"mimetype": "application/pdf", "binary_hash": 9293128959098327548, "filename": "rec_003258_acl.pdf", "uri": null}}}
./data/docling_uncertain_problem_retry_no_vlm_2026-07-08/chunks/rec_003258_acl.jsonl:41:{"candidate_id": "rec_003258_acl", "chunk_index": 41, "text": "Question: A 67-year-old man with transitional cell carcinoma of the bladder comes to the physician because of a 2-day history of ringing sensation in his ear. He received this first course of neoadjuvant chemotherapy 1 week ago. Pure tone audiometry shows a sensorineural hearing loss of 45 dB. The expected beneficial effect of the drug that caused this patient's symptoms is most likely due to\nwhich of the following actions?...", "contextualized_text": "3.3 Evaluation Results\nQuestion and Response\nQuestion: A 67-year-old man with transitional cell carcinoma of the bladder comes to the physician because of a 2-day history of ringing sensation in his ear. He received this first course of neoadjuvant chemotherapy 1 week ago. Pure tone audiometry shows a sensorineural hearing loss of 45 dB. The expected beneficial effect of the drug that caused this patient's symptoms is most likely due to\nwhich of the following actions?...", "headings": ["3.3 Evaluation Results", "Question and Response"], "pages": [7], "meta": {"schema_name": "docling_core.transforms.chunker.DocMeta", "version": "1.0.0", "doc_items": [{"self_ref": "#/texts/105", "parent": {"cref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "meta": null, "label": "text", "prov": [{"page_no": 7, "bbox": {"l": 77.09285510000001, "t": 757.2928866988575, "r": 518.1916401365606, "b": 703.4977315755826, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 395]}]}, {"self_ref": "#/texts/106", "parent": {"cref": "#/body"}, "children": [], "content_layer": "body", "meta": null, "label": "text", "prov": [{"page_no": 7, "bbox": {"l": 77.09285510000001, "t": 703.0931768488576, "r": 223.17300774245004, "b": 689.9470540755826, "coord_origin": "BOTTOMLEFT"}, "charspan": [0, 34]}]}], "headings": ["3.3 Evaluation Results", "Question and Response"], "captions": null, "origin": {"mime