es","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract is about multimodal oncology data integration and foundation-model-driven dataset generation, but it does not describe a substantive text or language component. That makes it outside the text-bio scope.","evidence_snippet":"\"Embedding-Based Deep Learning Frameworks for Multimodal Oncology Data Integration\"; \"foundation model-driven approach to generating multimodal oncology datasets\""},{"record_id":"rec_003261","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title explicitly says 'a survey' and the abstract says it 'comprehensively reviews' LLM applications in biomedical data analysis. This is a review rather than a primary model paper.","evidence_snippet":"\"The large language models on biomedical data analysis: a survey\"; \"This comprehensive review\""},{"record_id":"rec_003262","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract repeatedly frames the paper as a comprehensive review of LLMs in bioinformatics and 'systematically summarize[s] the current research status'. That is clearly review/editorial.","evidence_snippet":"\"This comprehensive review systematically examines...\""},{"record_id":"rec_003263","paper_type":"review_editorial","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"yes","text_bio_bridge_present":"yes","primary_exclusion_code":"review_editorial","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The title says 'A Survey of Multimodal Large Language Models in Biomedical Engineering and Healthcare', so this is a review paper rather than a primary model contribution.","evidence_snippet":"\"A Survey of Multimodal Large Language Models in Biomedical Engineering and Healthcare\""},{"record_id":"rec_003264","paper_type":"primary_model_paper","bio_modality_present":"yes","text_component_present":"no","text_bio_bridge_present":"no","primary_exclusion_code":"EC2_no_text_component","uncertainty_reason":"none","decision_rationale":"The abstract presents a new foundational agent for multi-omics interpretation with explicit reasoning and latent embeddings, but it does not describe a text or language component. It is therefore outside the generative text-bio scope.","evidence_snippet":"\"We introduce BiOmics, a foundational agent that synthesizes multi-omics data\"; \"explicit reasoning space\""}]}
